{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39736","headline":"伤蒋校书德山 · 黄滔","name":"伤蒋校书德山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁到双溪溪岸傍，与招魂魄上苍苍。\n世间无树胜青桂，陇上有花唯白杨。\n秦苑火然新赋在，越城山秀故居荒。\n如何万古雕龙手，独是相如识汉皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39736.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39736","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}